sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant ReactApp
  participant APIService
  participant FlaskBackend
  participant ModelLogic
  participant MongoDB

  User->>ReactApp: Fill prediction form & submit
  ReactApp->>APIService: Call predict API (Axios)
  APIService->>FlaskBackend: POST /predict
  FlaskBackend->>ModelLogic: Run prediction (LSTM/other)
  ModelLogic->>MongoDB: Fetch historical data
  MongoDB-->>ModelLogic: Return stock data
  ModelLogic-->>FlaskBackend: Return prediction result
  FlaskBackend-->>APIService: Respond with JSON
  APIService-->>ReactApp: Update UI with result
  ReactApp-->>User: Show prediction, charts, indicators
